From e7ae9333b95e0344c33affa570fd75ecfc2e6978 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michal Bicz <2608098+mbicz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 06:54:47 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] power: advance ambient brightness independently of sensor
 events

Use a regular 50 ms timer for the existing low-pass filter. Sensor notifications update the target rather than applying the elapsed quiet interval to a new target. Continue to the target even when the sensor level stops changing.

Keep manual changes immediate. Stop pending transitions on disable, idle, session deactivation, sensor loss and shutdown. Cover held readings, long quiet intervals and cancellation with the real power daemon on private D-Bus buses.

Signed-off-by: Michal Bicz <2608098+mbicz@users.noreply.github.com>
